<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">plant</ansi>

Slip an item from your backpack into an NPC's possession
or a container without being noticed.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">plant [item] [target]</ansi>

Uses the same skill check as <ansi fg="command">steal</ansi>.
Being hidden improves your chances.

Requires <ansi fg="skill">skullduggery</ansi> rank 1.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help steal</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help skullduggery</ansi>
